<title>USA: Simon Transport Services Inc Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Simon Transport Services Inc Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended</p>
<p>					 Dec. 31, 1996    Dec. 31, 1995</p>
<p> Operating Revenue		    34,166,193	 20,588,101</p>
<p> Operating income			2,433,269	  1,660,568</p>
<p> Net Income (Loss)		     1,235,694	(2,402,141)</p>
<p>Pro Forma:</p>
<p>   Net				     1,235,694	    516,402</p>
<p>   Avg shrs				4,743,154	  3,451,233</p>
<p>   Shr					   $0.26		$0.15</p>
<p>Note: Pro forma results adjusted for taxes related to conversion to C-corp from S-corp and IPO in Nov 1995.</p>
</text>
